rule purchase_ja_values v1
description "What ringi writes from the form of purchase.ja.ringi for the code it generates: the totals and computations over all the values what they read can take, and when a field is shown and asked for; the code holds each computation to its range"

elements lines
  quantity : number  range >=1 <=10_000
  price    : money[円]  range >=1円 <=50_000_000円

define subtotal : money[円] = quantity * price

max subtotal_most over lines of subtotal  empty 1円

sum amount over lines of subtotal  range >=0円 <=15_000_000_000_000円

outputs
  amount        : money[円]  round down(1円)
  subtotal_most : money[円]  round down(1円)
